# What tools/package-toolchain.ps1 leaves out of the static Qt
# (F:/ct/qt-custom-6.11p8/6.11.3-yap, 8.2 GB, 6937 files).
#
#   drop <glob>   not packed at all
#
# Only files no build reads are dropped. Every library and object is packed
# whole, read by today's build or not: CMake's imported targets need each
# library of a loaded Qt package to exist, and which ones the link pulls in
# changes with the QML imports. The first toolchain release packed 176 of
# them as empty stubs (those a clean build did not read on 2026-11-09);
# `import QtQuick.Window` then linked one and the link failed with LNK1136.
# package-toolchain.ps1 now refuses any packed file that differs from the
# source, and fetch-toolchain.ps1 any empty .lib or .obj.

drop doc/**
drop sbom/**
drop bin/*.pdb
